# Lock files are resolver output, not code. `linguist-generated=true` collapses
# them in GitHub's diff view and drops them from ordo-tui's review (`--all` keeps
# them). Listed across ecosystems, not just this repo's, so the file stays useful
# as the sample it is referenced as in the README.

